2026-07-27T14:04:02.3786568Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:04:02.3787444Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:04:02.3788744Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:04:02.3789993Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
